hifiberry-soloist-wrapper (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: package skeleton registering Spotify Soloist as an
    external Spotify Connect player.
    - ACR player descriptor and WebUI player card (Players page)
    - config-server permission drop-in for the soloist/soloist-bridge
      systemd units
    - user unit for the soloist service
    - ships drop-ins only -- Spotify's Soloist binary may not be
      redistributed and is fetched at runtime by a later package version

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000
